# Not Dead After All: Bot1 gives its Ornithopter (0/2) the dies trigger, then bolts it. It returns to the battlefield
# tapped under its owner's control with a Wicked Role attached: 1/3 (CR 603.10a, 400.7, 303.4i). The Role is on the
# battlefield, not in the graveyard, and no opponent loses life yet.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Not Dead After All
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Not Dead After All.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Ornithopter; Wicked
Bot1.Battlefield.Wicked.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Not Dead After All
Bot2.Life = 20
